A CSS escape cannot hide a style vector

```
[a]{style="background:u\rl(https://x/)"}
.
<p><span style="">a</span></p>
```

```
[a]{style="background:\75 rl(x)"}
.
<p><span style="">a</span></p>
```

```
[a]{style="background:URL\28 x)"}
.
<p><span style="">a</span></p>
```

```
[a]{style="background:ex\70 ression(x)"}
.
<p><span style="">a</span></p>
```
